{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46203","headline":"山居诗二十四首 十七 · 贯休","name":"山居诗二十四首 十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"慵刻芙蓉传永漏，休夸丽藻鄙汤休。\n且爲小囤盛红粟，别有珍禽胜白鸥。\n拾栗远寻深涧底，弄猨多在小峯头。\n不能更出尘中也，百炼刚爲绕指柔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46203.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46203","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}